  chooseText: Selected the survey scanner. If the signal source is still active,
    we need a map of the area and a hazard profile before moving closer.
  completedText: Survey scanner recovered. Surface readings are stable, but the ground
    below is not. There is a buried structure ahead, and it is still drawing power.
  nextDayText: Pilot, consistency beats intensity. One solid walk today is enough
    to keep momentum.
  showPortrait: 1
  descriptionText: A portable scanning system designed to analyze terrain, minerals,
    radiation, and hidden structures. It can help identify what lies beneath the
    surface.
